  (text "XMOS\n- U203 XU316-1024-QF60B: FUNCTION names only. Pin numbers are placeholders (?nn) and there is no footprint.\n  Replace it with the official XMOS library part before layout; assign I2S/GPIO to ports in the .xn file.\n  From the datasheet: USB_DM = 28, USB_DP = 29, USB_VDD33 = 30, USB_VDD18 = 31; core 0.855-0.945 V.\n- QSPI boot flash on X0D01 / X0D04-07 / X0D10 (check the boot-mode straps in the datasheet).\n- J202 debug header pinout is a placeholder: match it to your XTAG adapter."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "54be76e3-34aa-5626-b759-c644b539316c")
  )
